[CONTROLS]
LINK P11 OPEN AT TIME 6
LINK P11 CLOSED AT CLOCKTIME 2 PM
LINK PU2 CLOSED IF NODE T2 ABOVE 15
LINK PU2 OPEN IF NODE T2 BELOW 5

[RULES]
RULE 1
IF TANK T1 LEVEL ABOVE 20
THEN PUMP PU1 STATUS IS CLOSED

RULE 2
IF TANK T1 LEVEL BELOW 6
THEN PUMP PU1 STATUS IS OPEN

RULE 3
IF SYSTEM CLOCKTIME >= 7:00 AM
AND SYSTEM CLOCKTIME < 9:00 AM
AND TANK T1 LEVEL BELOW 18
THEN PUMP PU1 SETTING IS 1.1
ELSE PUMP PU1 SETTING IS 1.0

[OPTIONS]
Units      GPM
Headloss   H-W
Trials     80
Accuracy   0.001
Unbalanced Continue 10

[TIMES]
Duration            48:00
Hydraulic Timestep  1:00
